  {
    "id": "23a5174f-0741-5867-8021-e8fd81a4bebd",
    "pack": "myth-speakers",
    "kind": "feat",
    "slug": "feat:myth-hunter",
    "name": "Myth Hunter",
    "level": 1,
    "rarity": "uncommon",
    "traits": [],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "myth-speakers",
        "page": 82,
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Feats.aspx?ID=8006"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Trigger",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You successfully "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "3c873e49-a1c4-53b5-9694-66b860d94d43"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " to identify a creature that has the mythic trait."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Frequency",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " once per 10 minutes"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Your ancestors confronted and bested mythic beasts of Iblydan antiquity. Through a combination of hearing these tales and channeling a hint of those warriors' mythic power, you've developed a knack for bypassing a mythic creature's fabled defenses. The next time you successfully Strike the triggering creature, your Strike treats its mythic resistance as 2 lower. You treat its resistance as 4 lower if your Hero-God Lore or Legendary Beast Lore proficiency rank is expert, 6 lower if your rank is master, and 8 lower if your rank is legendary."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "If your Strike would already ignore mythic resistance (because you are a mythic character or wield a mythic weapon), your next successful Strike against the creature instead deals an additional 1d6 precision damage. This additional damage increases to 1d8 if your Hero-God Lore or Legendary Beast Lore proficiency rank is expert, 1d10 if your rank is master, or 1d12 if your rank is legendary."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.5ttqjN59TWIMImc3"
    },
    "data": {
      "category": "skill",
      "prerequisites": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "trained in Hero-God Lore or Legendary Beast Lore"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "action": {
        "cost": "free",
        "trigger": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You successfully Recall Knowledge to identify a creature that has the mythic trait."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "frequency": {
          "max": 1,
          "per": "ten-minutes"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "19d77a7e-6fdb-5799-aa7f-f925c6f4d0b8",
    "pack": "myth-speakers",
    "kind": "feat",
    "slug": "feat:myth-of-quick-thinking",
    "name": "Myth of Quick-Thinking",
    "level": 14,
    "rarity": "rare",
    "traits": ["mythic"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "myth-speakers"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Your myth includes amusing parables of clever plans and sly maneuvers, often applied to small things in life such as disguising yourself as a sheep to ambush a wolf or tricking a snake into shedding its skin. You can Lie as a two-action activity, regardless of how elaborate your tale. When you attempt a Deception check, you can spend a Mythic Point to do so at mythic proficiency. If you succeed at a Deception check while in the presence of your hierophant, any of your worshippers that you can see automatically succeed at an attempt to Impersonate or Lie in such a way that supports your story (for example, the target of your Lie claiming you are a teacher sees all of your worshippers as students)."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You also lay claim to one of the following domains of your choice: confidence, secrecy, or trickery."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.53sHAxpDg9KrkcGk"
    },
    "data": {
      "category": "class",
      "prerequisites": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Godling Dedication; hero-god accomplishment"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "prerequisiteClauses": [
        {
          "text": "Godling Dedication",
          "predicate": ["feat:godling-dedication"]
        },
        {
          "text": "hero-god accomplishment"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "bd69c1f7-d5d8-5a86-a3bf-7fb72ea7720b",
    "pack": "myth-speakers",
    "kind": "feat",
    "slug": "feat:myth-of-realm-walking",
    "name": "Myth of Realm-Walking",
    "level": 14,
    "rarity": "rare",
    "traits": ["mythic"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "myth-speakers"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Your myth speaks of distant travel to countless countries, planes, or dimensions. When any effect attempts to anchor you to a plane (such as "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "c116ade1-041d-5bc1-a428-dcd37ab4e61e"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ") or to banish you from the current plane (such as "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "b2355f5f-2795-58d8-a713-df34a0257e46"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "), that effect gains the incapacitation trait. If it already has the incapacitation trait, you gain a +4 status bonus to your save against the effect. If you successfully save against such an effect, the creature that attempted to use this effect on you must succeed at a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "save:will",
            "dc": {
              "against": "class-or-spell-dc"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " save against your class or spell DC (whichever is higher) to avoid becoming "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "9e1dad43-36fe-5629-923f-2df63c12d90f",
            "label": "Stupefied 1"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " for 1 minute ("
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "9e1dad43-36fe-5629-923f-2df63c12d90f",
            "label": "Stupefied 2"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " on a critical failure)."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You also lay claim to one of the following domains of your choice: dreams, fate, or travel."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "key": "FlatModifier",
        "selectors": ["saving-throw"],
        "type": "status",
        "value": 4,
        "predicate": [
          "item:trait:incapacitation",
          {
            "or": ["item:slug:planar-tether", "item:slug:banishment"]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.n7GdtqrIaQPGaptn"
    },
    "data": {
      "category": "class",
      "prerequisites": [
        {
