        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You've learned the secrets of the sphinx's riddles and empowered your ikon with them. You can voice these mysteries, forcing others to overcome them as you did."
