  {
    "id": "cf32f6c6-1348-5517-b74e-49a11523a6b0",
    "pack": "myth-speakers",
    "kind": "feat",
    "slug": "feat:stages-of-fate",
    "name": "Stages of Fate",
    "level": 8,
    "rarity": "rare",
    "traits": ["mythic"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "myth-speakers"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "At one time, the hero-gods could not tell their own prophecies. Ongalte, hero-god of deicide, defied this rule and cemented why it should be upheld. Those that can reach into the web of fates and pluck out a string are forbidden from speaking of their own myth. Yet nothing forbids them from speaking the myths of others."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You peer through the world around you to see the delicate threads connecting others to their fate when they become afflicted. Choose a creature within 30 feet that you can see and who you know is affected by an ongoing affliction that progresses through stages, such as most diseases or poisons. Spend 1 Mythic Point, then attempt a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "skill:religion"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " check at mythic proficiency against that affliction's DC."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Critical Success",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The next time the afflicted creature attempts a saving throw against the affliction, they automatically gain a critical success. If this results in the affliction coming to an end, you gain 1 Mythic Point."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Success",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The next time the afflicted creature attempts a saving throw against the affliction, they gain a +1 circumstance bonus to the roll and increase the result of the saving throw by one degree of success."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Failure",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The next time the afflicted creature attempts a saving throw against the affliction, they gain a +1 circumstance bonus."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Critical Failure",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You share the afflicted's fate, and are exposed to their affliction. You must immediately save against the affliction's effect."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.zJsu5JQGGOpyT6Xk"
    },
    "data": {
      "category": "class",
      "action": {
        "cost": "two"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "414f8089-a70c-5307-ba51-5d77fa82b33f",
    "pack": "myth-speakers",
    "kind": "feat",
    "slug": "feat:topple-the-titans",
    "name": "Topple The Titans",
    "level": 4,
    "rarity": "uncommon",
    "traits": ["exemplar"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "myth-speakers"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Frequency",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " Once per minute"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Requirements",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " Your previous action was a successful or critically successful "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "6257c7f0-f483-53d3-a791-d73a616cbce4"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " against a creature at least one size larger than you, and the enemy became "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "73c08daf-ef8e-5d9c-a2ac-dcdbfdafd759"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Even the greatest titans of the world are easier to kill when they're lying on the ground. You've made it your mission to topple such giants and can make others fall with a force that shakes the very earth. The triggering creature's toppling body shakes the ground, emitting a quake in a "
          },
          {
            "type": "template",
            "shape": "emanation",
            "size": 10
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " from their space. Apply the result of your triggering Athletics check against the Reflex DC of each creature in the emanation to Trip them as well. You do not need to have a hand free, and you do not lose your balance if any of your attempts to Trip are a critical failure."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.F8V4dN91JmHIOQCv"
    },
    "data": {
      "category": "class",
      "action": {
        "cost": "one",
        "requirementsText": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Your previous action was a successful or critically successful Trip against a creature at least one size larger than you, and the enemy became Prone."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "frequency": {
          "max": 1,
          "per": "minute"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "8275fe9b-5260-5562-ab9e-6251fed00d17",
    "pack": "myth-speakers",
    "kind": "feat",
    "slug": "feat:windborne-shove",
    "name": "Windborne Shove",
    "level": 8,
    "rarity": "rare",
    "traits": ["mythic"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "myth-speakers"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The hero-god of phalanxes and winds, grand Konebrys, led a force of dozens against an army of thousands. They gathered their soldiers in tight ranks, then marched against the wind to take the enemy by surprise. When a gust pushed the foes back, they struck their victorious blow."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You emulate Konebrys's tactics in pushing small forces against mighty foes. Whenever you are adjacent to an ally, creatures that attempt to "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "11d6f0fd-b182-5043-8a26-973179a93617"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " your space take a –2 circumstance penalty to their Acrobatics check."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "When you critically succeed on a melee Strike against an enemy, you can immediately attempt to "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "082b982f-3ed4-5d9c-9722-9ab10198523a"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " your target as a free action. You can spend a Mythic Point on this Shove attempt to do so at mythic proficiency."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.fjk8VsNDkVv1rjiu"
    },
    "data": {
      "category": "class",
      "prerequisites": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "guardian's Calling"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
]
